            "quote": "Revenue in 2025 is expected to be stronger than 2024, driven by record reported backlog of $10.7 billion at the end of the second quarter of 2025, recurring revenue programs continuing to see solid demand, a strong bid pipeline, and the impact of strategic acquisitions completed in the second half of 2024."
