        "summary": "The U.S. government enacted the One Big Beautiful Bill Act on July 4, 2025, repealing the requirement to capitalize and amortize domestic R&E expenditures under IRC Section 174 for tax years beginning after December 31, 2021, which prompted CSI to recognize a current income tax benefit of approximately $50 million in Q3 2025.",
        "attributes": {
          "jurisdiction": "US",
          "legislation": "One Big Beautiful Bill Act"
        },
        "sources": [
          {
            "source": "sedar",
            "formType": "interim-financial-statements",
            "filedOn": "2025-11-07",
            "quote": "On July 4, 2025, the U.S. government enacted comprehensive tax legislation, the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (the 'Act'). The Act repeals the requirement to capitalize and amortize domestic research and experimental ('R&E') expenditures under Internal Revenue Code Section 174 for tax years beginning after December 31, 2021."
          }
        ]
